### Create Room
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "user123",
    "roomName": "test_room",
    "config": {
        "maxParticipants": 10,
        "videoEnabled": true,
        "audioEnabled": true
    }
}

